# AI-Assisted End-to-End Automation Framework  
A modern, scalable, and intelligent end-to-end automation framework built using **Playwright**, **TypeScript**, and **Node.js**.  
This project demonstrates clean architecture, reusable components, CI/CD integration, and AI-assisted testing workflows.

---

## 🚀 Features

- **Playwright Test Runner** with parallel execution  
- **TypeScript** for type safety and cleaner code  
- **Page Object Model (POM)** architecture  
- **Auto-waiting & smart locators**  
- **Reusable utilities & fixtures**  
- **Cross-browser testing** (Chromium, Firefox, WebKit)  
- **GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline**  
- **HTML & Trace Viewer reports**  
- **AI-assisted locator healing (future enhancement)**  

---

## 📁 Project Structure

ai-e2e-automation/
│
├── tests/                 # Test specs
├── src/
│   ├── pages/             # Page Object classes
│   ├── utils/             # Helpers & utilities
│   ├── fixtures/          # Test data & fixtures
│   └── config/            # Environment configs
│
├── playwright.config.ts   # Playwright configuration
├── package.json           # Dependencies & scripts
└── README.md              # Project documentation


---

## 🧪 Running Tests

### Install dependencies
```bash
npm install
Install Playwright browsers :
npx playwright install
Run all tests :npx playwright test  :
npx playwright test


Run tests in UI mode :
npx playwright test --ui
Run tests in a specific browser :
npx playwright test --project=chromium
Debug mode :

npx playwright test --debug
Reports
Playwright automatically generates:

HTML Report

Trace Viewer

Screenshots on failure

Videos (optional)

To open the HTML report:

bash
npx playwright show-report

CI/CD – GitHub Actions
.github/workflows/playwright.yml
Future Enhancements
